"description": "Harrow, Inc. engages in the development, production, and sale of innovative medications. It operates through the following segments: Branded and ImprimisRx. The Branded segment includes activities of the company's FDA approved ophthalmology pharmaceutical products, including the out-licensing of rights to certain branded products. The ImprimisRx segment represents activities in the company's ophthalmology-focused pharmaceutical compounding business. The company was founded by Mark L. Baum and Robert J. Kammer on January 11, 2006 and is headquartered in Nashville, TN.",
